<title>HONG KONG: Kumagai Gumi 1996 net rises 33 percent.</title>
<headline>Kumagai Gumi 1996 net rises 33 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   119.8   vs  89.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    31.0    vs  28.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    450.6   vs  337.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,289.1 vs  3,472.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kumagai Gumi (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 11-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Kumagai Gumi (Hong Kong) is a construction company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 55 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 24 cents) vs 50 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
